1
00:00:00,345 --> 00:00:01,845
(Leonard:)-We came to apologize.
-Again.

2
00:00:02,014 --> 00:00:05,144
(Leonard:)And bring you home.
Pack up your stuff and we'll head back.

3
00:00:06,643 --> 00:00:08,733
(Leonard:)No. This is my home now.

4
00:00:08,896 --> 00:00:13,106
(Leonard:)Thanks to you, my career is over.
I will spend the rest of my life here...

5
00:00:13,275 --> 00:00:16,525
(Leonard:)...trying to teach evolution
to creationists.

6
00:00:19,323 --> 00:00:21,073
(Mrs Cooper:)You watch your mouth, Shelly.

7
00:00:22,159 --> 00:00:23,989
(Mrs Cooper:)Everyone's entitled to their opinion.

8
00:00:24,161 --> 00:00:26,661
(Sheldon:)Evolution isn't an opinion, it's fact.

9
00:00:26,830 --> 00:00:30,250
(Mrs Cooper:)And that is your opinion.

10
00:00:32,753 --> 00:00:34,173
(Sheldon:)I forgive you, let's go home.

11
00:00:38,675 --> 00:00:39,715
[CHUCKLES]

12
00:00:39,885 --> 00:00:42,515
(Mrs Cooper:)Don't tell me prayer doesn't work.

13
00:00:49,853 --> 00:00:53,143
(Leonard:)How about that?
Finally caught a break.

14
00:00:53,315 --> 00:00:54,645
(Leonard:)Uh-huh.

15
00:00:54,816 --> 00:00:56,146
[PENNY CHUCKLES]

16
00:00:58,695 --> 00:01:02,825
(Leonard:)You know how they say
when friends have sex it can get weird?

17
00:01:02,991 --> 00:01:04,571
(Sheldon:)Sure.

18
00:01:05,535 --> 00:01:09,785
(Leonard:)-Why does it have to get weird?
-Pbbt. I don't know.

19
00:01:09,957 --> 00:01:14,877
(Leonard:)I mean, we were friends
and now we're more than friends.

20
00:01:15,045 --> 00:01:19,965
And we're whatever this is.
But why label it, right? I mean--

21
00:01:20,133 --> 00:01:21,423
(Leonard:)It is what it is and--

22
00:01:21,593 --> 00:01:22,633
(Penny:)-Leonard?
-Yeah?

23
00:01:22,803 --> 00:01:24,883
(Penny:)-It's weird.
-Totally.

